{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for object, approach, grab and retrieve. If object not found, repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextSearchArea    /> <Condition ID = isObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = isObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = TaskSpecificBehavior    />",
